      "content": "preeclampsia? that sounds scary. i dont have any real pain tho, just the swelling and the weird vision stuff. do u think it's really worth driving to the hospital at this hour? i'm just super tired and honestly it's kinda hard to move around much right now, so i'd rather just wait and see how i feel in the morning if it isn't an emergency.",
